# bomb-pickup.px - bomb stock pickup
# canvas 12x12, 2 frames (pulse pair, loop): a = core at rest, b = core flares (hot fire-4 centre grows).
# gold octagonal shell (gold ramp), K outline and K socket ring around a 4x4 orange core (fire ramp).
# light: top-left on the shell; the core is self-lit (hot centre, cooler corners).
# smallest must-read feature: orange core 4x4 inside the gold shell.
# anchor: frame centre (6,6).
# timing: a 200 ms, b 133 ms.
